                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains the following information:\n\n- do_files: the codes to reproduce the analysis of chapter 3 in STATA can be found.\n- _webb_data: it contains the data and codes to reproduce the AI and robot score used in the analysis\n- _onet_to_isco: contains the codes to convert SOC occupations to ISCO. This has been downloaded from: https://ibs.org.pl/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/onetsoc_to_isco_cws_ibs_en1-1.pdf\n- _felten et al contains the data and do files to compute the AI exposure score from Felten et al (2019)\n- a ReadMe detailing the analysis\n\nThe data used in this chapter comes from the European Union Structure of Earning Survey (EU-SES). This data cannot not be made available due to Eurostat regulations."
                },
